 "purpose": "Fills in the automatic parts of the handbook (docs/handleiding/**/*.md): learning-line tables, thinking errors, cheat sheets and start arguments, between <!-- auto:... --> markers.",
 "details": "Reads each handbook page, replaces the text between `<!-- auto:<soort> <arg> -->` and `<!-- /auto -->` with freshly generated lines and writes the file back (or, with --controleer, only reports and exits 1 when something is out of date; tests/test_handleiding.py uses this). The generators read the program itself: leerlijn_tabel loads the learning-line JSON (kern/leerlijnen) and shows one column per school year with readable parameter names (the PARAMETERS and SOORTEN tables) and 'idem' or '+ ...' for unchanged or added values; denkfouten and spiekbrief read the ONDERWERPEN registry (the unit conversion topic is special-cased); argumenten lists the argparse options of leeravontuur/__main__.maak_parser. Run it after any change to a learning line, a cheat sheet or a start argument.",
 "module_docstring": "Vult de automatische stukken van de handleiding in (docs/handleiding/**/*.md).",
